Description: A simple tool to retrieve headers, titles, and footnotes from
    structured metadata sources (e.g., Excel or CSV files) for annotating
    tables, listings, and figures in clinical study reports (CSRs). It
    supports separation of metadata from analysis code in clinical
    reporting workflows.
